"""
build_gallery.py - Portable Thumbdrive Gallery Builder
Scans photos and videos on the thumbdrive, extracts EXIF/IPTC/XMP metadata (people face regions, tags, dates),
generates optimized thumbnails and face avatars, and produces a zero-CORS gallery_data.js.
Designed to sit in the /Gallery folder and index root media directories.
"""

